---
layout: base.njk
title: Effective Perspective
description: Articles and updates on employment law and HR from The Effective Law Group.
section: insights
permalink: /effective-perspective/index.html
---
<main id="main">
<section class="page-hero">
<div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Insights</div>
<h1>Effective Perspective</h1>
<p class="lead">Articles and updates on employment law and HR, written for employers.</p>
</section>
<div class="cols">
<div class="main">
{% if collections.articles.length %}
<div class="posts">
{% for post in collections.articles %}
<article class="card post-card">
{% if post.data.image %}<img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.image_alt }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
<p class="meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time></p>
<h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
<p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
<a class="more" href="{{ post.url }}">Read the article<span class="sr">: {{ post.data.title }}</span> →</a>
</article>
{% endfor %}
</div>
{% else %}
<p class="intro">New articles are on their way. In the meantime, you can read about Natasha&rsquo;s book or see how we help employers.</p>
{% endif %}
</div>
<aside>
<div class="aside-card"><h3>Also by Natasha</h3><p style="margin-bottom:16px">Mandemic, a book about building 32 everyday habits.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="/effective-perspective/mandemic-book-by-natasha-jones/">About the book</a></div>
<div class="aside-card"><h3>Looking for employment law support?</h3><p style="margin-bottom:16px">Natasha helps employers with employment law and HR, for a fixed fee.</p><a class="btn" href="/hr-employment/">See our services</a></div>
</aside>
</div>
</main>
